# Front-end environment configuration (build-time only).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the value for your environment.
# Vite inlines `VITE_`-prefixed variables at build time, so these are NOT
# runtime secrets and must never hold sensitive data.
#
# `VITE_API_URL` is read exclusively by `src/config.ts` (the config seam).
# Base URL of the back-end API that serves `GET /products` and
# `GET /products/:id`.
#
# Leave it empty to keep the app offline: API calls then resolve to a friendly
# error state instead of hitting the network.
VITE_API_URL=
